{"catch":"操控 MAD X，奪回被偷走的資金！","desc":"《Route16 Turbo》是一款於 1985 年推出的動作遊戲。\n\n駕駛你的愛車 MAD X，閃避不斷追擊的敵方車輛，潛入邪惡組織 Kanharoo 軍團的秘密基地，奪回所有被偷走的資金。\n\n在探索複雜迷宮的「迷宮模式」（Maze Mode）與顯示由 16 個迷宮構成的整體關卡的「雷達模式」（Radar Mode）之間即時切換，帶來持續緊張刺激的追逐動作體驗。\n\n本版本亦收錄了在 1985 年原版中無法到達的關卡。\n現在正是挑戰並刷新當年最高分的最佳時機！","publisher":"SUNSOFT","release":"2026-08-06","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b76d788d15e9203c0f7eace64292275867a0c436462aea755c9bc9cdfd54d494.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/590eb354d8088d95dbf3aa0a21b53bebc0ae250494cee3f4dea645fff98f9571.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c289c3ae2bf8f1e46c4926fcb3d30755cfac679589c921af368b48880053163.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6ff95b3393c1f525c35825c73a3beec5986d9763ba8c5bfff36d1cf91dc059cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e14446881dcbc2927a237ab48d8fb1b0a9e274f61fc6d9bc64a83dd625db777.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec591b6d9ca1703cfb7db3be6bec80f092852e54bd3a3816c6f2797403b23e37.jpg"]}